[{"form_id":"0x000805|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"NPC_ SHRT","string":"エイサ"},{"form_id":"0x0008DB|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"KEYM FULL","string":"エイサの家の鍵"},{"form_id":"0x0008E5|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"あなたはフロストミヤ墓地にいた。"},{"form_id":"0x0008E6|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その通り。最近は厄介事にうんざりしてるの。何が目当てなの?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E7|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"あそこの山賊は始末した。"},{"form_id":"0x0008E8|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふん、そんなことだろうと思ったわ。残念ね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E9|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"剣を見つけて、蒼白の淑女と戦った。"},{"form_id":"0x0008EA|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"神にかけて、本気なのね","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008EA|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まさか本当にそこまでたどり着いて、生きて帰ってくるなんて。何があったの?","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008EB|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼女は追放された。だが、あなたのカジートの友人は死んだ。"},{"form_id":"0x0008EC|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、私……そう。その……分かったわ。ありがとう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EC|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"さっきはごめんなさい。旅の中で、あなたに並ぶ腕を持つ人にはめったに出会ったことがないわ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008EC|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"早まった判断をしてしまって、許してちょうだい。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008EE|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"あの墓地では本当に運が良かったな"},{"form_id":"0x0008EF|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ええ、もちろん。私ったら何を考えてたのかしら。まだ生きてるなんて信じられないわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F1|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"モーサルに留まるつもりか?"},{"form_id":"0x0008F2|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ええ。運命が理由があって私をここに導いたんだと思ったの。だから留まった。ちょっとおかしいと思うでしょう?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F4|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あら、あなたね。何の用? 私から盗みに来たんじゃないでしょうね?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F5|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"また会えて嬉しいわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F6|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ここを一掃できるなら喜んでやろう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F7|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よく来たわね。強い酒を一杯やれば、この寒さも吹き飛ぶわよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FF|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いろいろ噂があるのよ……吸血鬼だって言う人もいる……あなた、あの騒ぎに関わってないわよね?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000901|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"町から遠くへ出かけるなら気をつけて。山賊にやられなくても、獣にやられるわよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FA|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よい狩りを。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FB|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"じゃあ、仕事に戻るわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FD|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"仲間が欲しいんだ。一緒に来ないか?"},{"form_id":"0x0008FE|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まだよ。仕事があるの。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090C|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"仲間が欲しいんだ。一緒に来ないか?"},{"form_id":"0x00090F|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"できることなら何でも喜んで手伝うわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090F|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この町の退屈な暮らしを紛らわせてくれるなら、何でも歓迎よ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000804|environs - hroggars house.esp","type":"LCTN FULL","string":"エイサの家"}]